    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1256">

                <pb facs="0928" n="852" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg852"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.812/237a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Long </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-09-01T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 1, 1916, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Press reports several occasions that Salvador has presented its case against
                    Nicaragua to the Central American Court. Cable if this is true and if there are
                    any new developments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
